# Strategy parameters

Do not add constants used by signal/risk logic inside strategy implementations. Every knob belongs on that mode's params object and is set in `*ParamsFor`.

Regime lookup tables are allowed only as the mapping that **fills** those params. `evaluate*` must read `params.foo`, not a module constant.

```typescript
// BAD
const THRESHOLD = 0.15;
if (depth < THRESHOLD) return hold;

// GOOD
if (depth < params.threshold) return hold;
```
